{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026s9JKQ4zJtc1794581204.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>外長王毅表示，中美應該秉持互相尊重，擴大合作。</p><p></p><p>王毅在北京會見出席中美政黨對話的美方代表。王毅稱，中美兩個大國應當通過不間斷對話交流，明確共同努力的目標、擴大互利合作的領域、夯實雙邊關係的基礎，並致力於維護世界和平穩定。</p><p></p><p>雙方應秉持相互尊重、和平共處、合作共贏理念，將國家主席習近平與美國總統特朗普關於構建基於尊重、公平、對等的中美建設性戰略穩定關係的共識，落到實處。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T15:23:35.631632+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":184,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T13:39:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T10:16:39.890570+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T15:16:47.439545+00:00","content_hash":"d2e45488b2e4c5ecb9d06bec4aae1c96d20d04e14165a489b12c0f3a7a8e1d4e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T15:23:35.631632+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}